### Health
GET http://localhost:3000/api/health

### Student login
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"anna@uni.demo","password":"Student123!"}

### Lecturer login
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"lecturer@uni.demo","password":"Lecturer123!"}

### After login, copy accessToken below
@token = REPLACE_ME

### Student dashboard
GET http://localhost:3000/api/student/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Student QR credential
GET http://localhost:3000/api/attendance/credential
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Lecturer dashboard
GET http://localhost:3000/api/lecturer/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
